{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Color-slurping invaders!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aliens are invading the garden, and they're here to steal color! Our pocket-sized robot sets out to defeat them, restoring color and saving the garden by using its paint to boost and pacify the aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the desaturated garden, befriending critters and restoring its colorful glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a small, contained world seen through perspective of a smaller being.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy-to-learn paint-surfing moveset with elements of mastery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game is a short game experience made by students of Breda University of Applied Sciences over the course of 32 weeks.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365820?t=1749029194","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365820?t=1749029194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/dc67c2fc1cd0c99590a4b02bd4e183cec39e02d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749029194","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/dc67c2fc1cd0c99590a4b02bd4e183cec39e02d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749029194","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3642480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Color-slurping invaders!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aliens are invading the garden, and they're here to steal color! Our pocket-sized robot sets out to defeat them, restoring color and saving the garden by using its paint to boost and pacify the aliens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p